---
import Features2 from '~/components/widgets/Features2.astro';
import Features3 from '~/components/widgets/Features3.astro';
import Hero from '~/components/widgets/Hero.astro';
import Stats from '~/components/widgets/Stats.astro';
import Steps2 from '~/components/widgets/Steps2.astro';
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'About',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <!-- Hero Widget ******************* -->

<Hero
  tagline=""
>
  <Fragment slot="title">
    Designing digital products with <br />
    <span class="text-accent dark:text-white">clarity, motion, and intention.</span>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="subtitle">
    I’m <strong>David de Jesús</strong>, a Senior <strong>Product Designer</strong> focused on <strong>motion-driven interfaces, interaction design, and scalable UI systems</strong> for digital products.
  </Fragment>
</Hero>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <p>
    Since 2009, I’ve worked across <strong>web, mobile, and large-screen experiences</strong>, helping teams design <strong>clear, responsive, and intuitive products</strong>. My background sits at the intersection of product design, interface design, and motion systems, where motion is treated as a <strong>functional layer of the user experience</strong> rather than visual decoration.
  </p><br />

  <p>
    I specialize in using motion to <strong>clarify workflows, explain system state, guide user attention, and improve usability</strong>. I design and build interaction logic using tools like <strong>Rive</strong>, create state machines for dynamic interfaces, and prototype behavior-rich experiences that help teams <strong>validate ideas and ship with confidence</strong>.
  </p><br />

  <p>
    My process combines <strong>product thinking, UI design, and animation craft</strong>. I focus on timing, transitions, and feedback to ensure motion decisions support both <strong>user needs and design system consistency</strong>. I work closely with product managers and engineers to deliver <strong>production-ready solutions</strong> that scale across platforms and devices.
  </p><br />

  <p>
    Based in <strong>Guadalajara, México</strong>, I collaborate with teams and clients worldwide. Alongside client work, I’ve spoken at conferences and led workshops on <strong>product design, UI motion, and prototyping</strong>, sharing hands-on experience with designers and developers working on real-world products.
  </p><br />

  <p>
    I see motion as a <strong>design language within product design</strong>. When used intentionally, it can reduce cognitive load, reinforce usability, and help digital products communicate with <strong>clarity and personality</strong>.
  </p><br />
</div>

<Features3
  title="What I Work On"
  subtitle="I bring product thinking, interface design, and motion together to create digital experiences that are clear, responsive, and built to scale."
  columns={3}
  isBeforeContent={true}
  items={[
    {
      title: 'Product Design',
      description:
        'Designing clear, intuitive experiences for web and mobile products, from early concepts and flows to polished interfaces.',
      icon: 'tabler:devices',
    },
    {
      title: 'UI & Interaction',
      description:
        'Designing interfaces, transitions, and feedback that help people understand what is happening and what they can do next.',
      icon: 'tabler:click',
    },
    {
      title: 'Rive & Motion',
      description:
        'Building interactive Rive animations and state machines for behavior-rich interfaces, prototypes, and product experiences.',
      icon: 'tabler:ease-in-out-control-points',
    },
    {
      title: 'Motion Systems',
      description:
        'Creating reusable motion patterns that bring consistency to transitions, feedback, and interaction across a product.',
      icon: 'tabler:transform',
    },
    {
      title: 'Interactive Prototypes',
      description:
        'Prototyping complex product flows and interactions to make ideas tangible, test behavior, and align teams before development.',
      icon: 'tabler:arrow-guide',
    },
    {
      title: 'Design Systems',
      description:
        'Connecting UI, interaction, and motion decisions into scalable systems that work consistently across platforms and devices.',
      icon: 'tabler:components',
    },
  ]}
/>
</Layout>
